@startuml
title Deployment Diagram - OptiMind Runtime Topology
left to right direction

node "User Device" {
  artifact "Web Browser\nReact SPA (dev :3000 / built static assets)" as Browser
}

node "Application Server" {
  artifact "Node.js + Express API\n:4000" as API
  artifact "Prisma Client\nORM runtime" as PrismaClient
  folder "uploads/\navatars, inventory images, invoices, proofs, sources" as UploadFolder
  folder "backups/\ndatabase and file archives" as BackupFolder
  artifact "Scheduler\nbudget prediction jobs" as Scheduler
}

node "Database Server" {
  database "PostgreSQL\nPrisma-managed schema" as PG
}

cloud "Gmail OAuth + SMTP/API" as Mail
cloud "AI Provider" as AI

Browser --> API : REST /api/*
API --> PrismaClient : model queries and transactions
PrismaClient --> PG : SQL
API --> UploadFolder : upload/read files
API --> BackupFolder : write/read backup archives
Scheduler --> API : budget prediction jobs
API --> Mail : reset, workflow and review emails
API --> AI : chatbot/agent requests

note right of Browser
The frontend hides Finance navigation for users
outside the Finance department (except Admin).
end note
@enduml
